                <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#111827;align=left;spacing=12;fontSize=14;" value="REUSABLE AI EVENT CATALOG&#xa;AI output is validated and saved in event_data for reuse by other players.&#xa;One event_data -&gt; many runs_event (references + player choices).&#xa;Multiple stories may share packageId/day; catalog IDs stay distinct.&#xa;User.saveGame points to game_runs. Effects apply only on choice.&#xa;game_report is placed beside runs_event for readability.&#xa;REF is gameRunId, not runsEventId. One report per resolved wave.&#xa;Schema targets long campaigns (~100 days): many events and many waves.&#xa;Event outcomes live in runs_event + actions/properties.&#xa;state version 3: wallLevel, troopLevel, cityLevel.&#xa;UQ*: (userId, startRequestId). UQ game_report: (gameRunId, wave).&#xa;Auth: bcrypt + JWT (jsonwebtoken). actionId comes from client.&#xa;Backend AI/persistence still pending." vertex="1">
